NOTE ON DATA. This licence covers the CODE in this repository. It does NOT
cover the underlying datasets, which remain under their own terms:

  CLINC-150            CC BY 3.0
  GoEmotions           Apache 2.0
  MTOP                 CC BY-SA 4.0 (Meta)
  DBpedia Classes      CC BY-SA (Wikipedia-derived)
  twitter-financial-news-topic   no stated licence; tweet text

Because those terms differ and one source is unlicensed tweet text, the
published dataset in dataset/v3-public/ contains NO item text — only SHA-256
hashes of it, alongside every label, distractor list and derived field.
`python -m harness.rebuild_texts` restores the texts from the original sources
and verifies each against its published hash.
